    "name": "Cocoloco Beach Resort",
    "detail": "Pros - Room - it appears to be part of their newer facility/ new room. Very clean. Cozy. Housekeeping makes it a point to clean it daily. - I arrived in the Island around 8am and was allowed to check in earlier than the usual Check in time of most hotels at 2pm. - Welcome drinks served as indicated on their ad. Staff - very friendly and accommodating. Customer Service is excellent. Even their Hotel Manager is very accommodating and pays alot of attention to their clients. If you are looking for some peace and quiet - this is the best location. The rooms even have their own balcony to chill. The location of the hotel is away from the hustle and bustle of the island. Cons - Restaurant food is a bit pricey. But my over-all experience in this hotel is excellent. I will definitely book my future Boracay trips here. ",
